{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6/28のリアルミーグリ🩷"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobUt9arz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いに来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob1OVs4y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobJNM3ML.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリで初めて浴衣を着ました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと、意外かなと思ってピンク系にしてみました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "謎に1人で着られる自信がありましたが、1人じゃ無理でした☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "璃花ちゃんと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいなちゃんと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとちゃんが色々お手伝いしてくれました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他の子の着付けをほとんどしてあげてたり、自分も着なきゃいけないのに、私がちょうど困ってるタイミングで助けに来てくれるのでヒーローすぎました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先生が3人もいて心強かったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先生方ありがとう！！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おかげさまで浴衣を着ることができました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobHhcsAI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobE4oxo6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobXY3XyU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobrz48ze.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob2UU8mo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobSgkbqM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobtEWEPM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob2ahdLg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobHy0bO5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobW6M4ZO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花もありがとうございました！！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どれもとっても素敵で、とっても嬉しかったです💐✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🌺🌴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "里奈"}], "source": "official"}